# What the demo module exports, which is what a caller may call.
#
# Stands in for a binding generator's interface description: the dev tool
# compares these bytes and never parses them, so a fixture needs only a file
# that moves when the callable surface moves and holds still when only the
# module's code does. `native_libs_reload_e2e_test.dart`'s web case edits the
# module alone for one verdict and this file for the other.
demo_add(i32, i32) -> i32
